WEBVTT

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.875
The ultimate stage... is calling for me.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:46.000
<i>Zetsubou teki ni kimi wa kirei sa</i>

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:54.042
<i>Hanten suru sekai no platonic aishi aou</i>

00:01:00.292 --> 00:01:10.667
<i>Bokura ga miteru sekai wa</i>
<i>itsu demo sakasama de</i>

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:19.667
<i>Doushiyou mo nai koto de taigai kimatteku</i>

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:25.292
<i>Namida suru hodo kizutsuku hitomi</i>

00:01:25.292 --> 00:01:31.542
<i>Kokoro de sakebi nagara damatte ita</i>

00:01:31.542 --> 00:01:43.625
<i>Saigo no futari mazare nai</i>
<i>mama byouyomi ga kikoetekuru</i>

00:01:43.625 --> 00:01:48.250
<i>Zetsubou teki ni kimi wa kirei sa</i>

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:54.167
<i>Sutare yuku doubutsu mitai ni aishi aou</i>

00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:58.667
<i>Nakitai kurai kimi wa kirei sa</i>

00:01:58.667 --> 00:02:04.750
<i>Hanten suru sekai no platonic kanjitai yo</i>

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:17.292
"Wing's Revival"

00:02:21.083 --> 00:02:24.000
This tone... This melody!

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.833
It's suitable for the last movement!

00:02:26.833 --> 00:02:31.333
More! Play it more, Aquarion!

00:02:31.333 --> 00:02:35.708
Shrade! How can you still have
such power in your condition?!

00:02:35.708 --> 00:02:40.833
Incredible! It's elegant and delicate,
and yet keen and passionate!

00:02:40.833 --> 00:02:43.542
It ecstatically echoes to the back of my heart!

00:02:43.542 --> 00:02:45.542
I've never experienced
anything like this before!

00:02:46.542 --> 00:02:51.917
Shrade... In order to expose
his skin and sharpen his senses,

00:02:51.917 --> 00:02:54.083
he did not wear an Element suit.

00:02:54.083 --> 00:02:58.375
But it must be taking quite
a heavy toll on his body.

00:02:58.375 --> 00:03:01.625
This is, indeed, a desperate battle!

00:03:01.625 --> 00:03:04.125
Shrade...

00:03:04.125 --> 00:03:08.292
The best cadenza for my soul...!

00:03:12.667 --> 00:03:16.417
What I saw that time wasn't an illusion.

00:03:16.417 --> 00:03:19.625
You are me...

00:03:19.625 --> 00:03:24.583
No wonder you haven't had a scent
from the moment I first met you...

00:03:24.583 --> 00:03:27.875
it's because your smell is the same as my own.

00:03:27.875 --> 00:03:31.625
The one in this picture is me...

00:03:31.625 --> 00:03:34.375
...and you as well.

00:03:34.375 --> 00:03:38.708
Originally, you and I were one person...

00:03:38.708 --> 00:03:41.000
...right... until that day.

00:03:43.042 --> 00:03:47.250
Mommy! No... No!

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:49.667
Don't go!

00:03:56.167 --> 00:03:57.667
What?

00:04:08.083 --> 00:04:14.000
On that day, the Amata who could do
nothing but let his fate pass him by...

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.792
That was you.

00:04:19.583 --> 00:04:22.125
It means you haven't changed.

00:04:22.125 --> 00:04:26.667
You're still the wimpy Amata who
freezes up when the going gets tough.

00:04:26.667 --> 00:04:29.000
Then, what about you?!

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.542
You couldn't save Mom!

00:04:31.542 --> 00:04:34.708
You went all the way to Altair...
and what did you accomplish?!

00:04:35.958 --> 00:04:41.667
I was able to cross the dimension,
but I got separated from her.

00:04:41.667 --> 00:04:44.833
And there, I met Mykage.

00:04:44.833 --> 00:04:50.542
Welcome, other half... Dark Amata.

00:04:55.917 --> 00:04:59.000
You are Kagura.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.375
From today on, you are Kagura.

00:05:03.167 --> 00:05:07.375
I lost my memory and was raised by Mykage.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:13.208
I don't care about our mother anymore...

00:05:13.208 --> 00:05:17.833
...just as I don't care about the
father we know nothing about.

00:05:17.833 --> 00:05:21.417
There's only one smell that's important to me...

00:05:21.417 --> 00:05:24.333
The smell of the damn woman I love.

00:05:24.333 --> 00:05:26.583
The real Silffy is the only one for me!

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:31.208
I'm not a wimp!

00:05:31.208 --> 00:05:34.375
I'm not gonna let you have Mikono!

00:05:39.583 --> 00:05:42.042
You're weak. You're weak.

00:05:42.042 --> 00:05:44.125
You're too weak!

00:05:44.125 --> 00:05:47.542
Stop it! Why are you two fighting?!

00:05:47.542 --> 00:05:50.417
Please! Stop it now!

00:05:52.542 --> 00:05:56.083
Solar Wing finally awakens.

00:05:56.083 --> 00:05:57.583
What?

00:06:32.417 --> 00:06:34.292
What's the matter, Amata?

00:06:34.292 --> 00:06:37.250
Why don't you prove you're not a wimp?

00:06:44.333 --> 00:06:45.875
What?!

00:06:53.958 --> 00:06:54.958
Mikono!

00:06:54.958 --> 00:06:56.458
Silffy!

00:07:00.583 --> 00:07:02.083
Mikono!

00:07:11.875 --> 00:07:13.667
Aquarion?!

00:07:19.417 --> 00:07:21.417
What's going on?!

00:07:21.417 --> 00:07:23.417
High-dimensional quantum energy detected!

00:07:23.417 --> 00:07:25.667
It's coming from an area below
where a lake used to be!

00:07:40.667 --> 00:07:42.250
What are these?!

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:44.917
Aquarion is resonating?!

00:07:44.917 --> 00:07:50.417
This is an ancient melody echoing
from twelve thousand years ago...?!

00:07:51.833 --> 00:07:55.167
There's no mistake. That is, indeed...

00:07:55.167 --> 00:07:58.417
...the legendary Mythic Aquarion!

00:08:06.833 --> 00:08:09.375
Oh... Oh...!

00:08:09.375 --> 00:08:14.292
Finally... Solar Wing has shown itself!

00:08:23.792 --> 00:08:25.542
Where am I?

00:08:27.708 --> 00:08:29.375
Aquarion?

00:08:29.375 --> 00:08:31.708
No, that's...

00:08:31.708 --> 00:08:33.292
Mikono...

00:08:33.292 --> 00:08:35.042
Mikono!

00:08:35.042 --> 00:08:36.458
Amata!

00:08:36.458 --> 00:08:38.042
Silffy!

00:08:39.583 --> 00:08:42.083
I missed you, Silffy!

00:08:42.083 --> 00:08:47.625
After twelve thousand years,
I can now finally kill you!

00:08:47.625 --> 00:08:49.542
You're gonna kill Mikono?!

00:08:49.542 --> 00:08:52.750
That's right. I'll kill her!

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:55.542
So bitterly and fiercely that
it'll chill you to your very bones...

00:08:55.542 --> 00:08:58.125
I'll kill you over and over again till the end.

00:08:59.708 --> 00:09:02.667
But before that...

00:09:02.667 --> 00:09:06.083
Amata! I'm gonna kill you!

00:09:06.083 --> 00:09:07.958
Just wait, Silffy!

00:09:07.958 --> 00:09:11.583
Once I let him survive, let's kill each
other fully until the morning comes!

00:09:11.583 --> 00:09:13.250
What? Wait...

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:16.042
I'm not gonna let you lay a finger on her!

00:09:30.292 --> 00:09:34.208
The high-dimensional quantum energy
level is continuing to increase!

00:09:34.208 --> 00:09:37.750
There's no doubt. This is the real thing.

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:40.542
Mythic Aquarion...

00:09:40.542 --> 00:09:43.000
The legend has finally become reality.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:47.458
We are witnessing such an
incredible historical moment?

00:09:47.458 --> 00:09:50.792
Yeah... And at a time like this...

00:09:50.792 --> 00:09:53.542
...what the heck are they doing?!

00:09:53.542 --> 00:09:57.167
That too is a legend.

00:09:57.167 --> 00:10:00.083
Supreme Commander Fudo!
When did you get back?!

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:05.625
Never interfere in a... lovers' quarrel!

00:10:11.333 --> 00:10:12.833
Amata!

00:10:22.333 --> 00:10:23.833
I'm not gonna let you have her!

00:10:23.833 --> 00:10:25.583
Just give up.

00:10:25.583 --> 00:10:29.750
This is the fate that was decided
twelve thousand years ago.

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:33.000
The one who'll be united with Silffy isn't you.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:36.750
No matter how hard you struggle,
you can't overcome fate.

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:40.375
Silffy and I were able to meet even
though we were on different planets

00:10:40.375 --> 00:10:42.458
precisely because we were guided by fate.

00:10:42.458 --> 00:10:46.583
I have wings that let me jump over fate!

00:10:49.417 --> 00:10:52.333
Having wings doesn't do you
much good if you can't fly.

00:10:52.333 --> 00:10:55.625
Can you fly? Now, go ahead and fly!

00:10:58.042 --> 00:11:02.125
Stop it! Stop hurting Amata!

00:11:02.125 --> 00:11:04.917
Your smile is terrible, too, Silffy.

00:11:04.917 --> 00:11:07.292
It makes me wanna kill you even more.

00:11:07.292 --> 00:11:10.333
Smile... Smile more!

00:11:10.333 --> 00:11:13.292
More! More!

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.833
Where am I?

00:11:31.375 --> 00:11:34.417
Did I... die?

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:37.792
Amata!

00:11:37.792 --> 00:11:40.958
Good! You're okay, Zessica!

00:11:40.958 --> 00:11:42.208
You're okay, too, Amata!

00:11:42.208 --> 00:11:46.667
Ah... could it be that you came back
because you worried about me?

00:11:49.042 --> 00:11:55.292
Zessica, I finally realized...
what was really important.

00:11:55.292 --> 00:11:56.792
Amata...

00:11:59.083 --> 00:12:01.542
So, wake up.

00:12:04.083 --> 00:12:08.000
You can't die yet... because...

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:14.500
...you've not yet fulfilled
the promise you made to me.

00:12:18.083 --> 00:12:21.042
Nooo!

00:12:27.042 --> 00:12:29.500
You can't die yet...

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:34.542
...because you've not yet fulfilled
the promise you made to me.

00:12:38.292 --> 00:12:40.042
Promise...

00:12:43.708 --> 00:12:46.208
Please! I'm begging you! Stop it!

00:12:46.208 --> 00:12:49.792
I don't wanna see you two hurting each other!

00:12:49.792 --> 00:12:51.667
No, Mikono!

00:12:51.667 --> 00:12:54.042
I'll make it clear today for sure!

00:12:54.042 --> 00:12:57.625
Huh? And just what are
you going to make clear?

00:12:57.625 --> 00:13:02.125
Do you want Mikono because it's fate?!

00:13:02.125 --> 00:13:05.125
That's right. Don't make me repeat it.

00:13:05.125 --> 00:13:08.167
That's not the case for me!

00:13:08.167 --> 00:13:11.333
Whether Mikono is a
reincarnation of Silffy or not...

00:13:11.333 --> 00:13:13.167
Or what the fate from twelve
thousand years ago was...

00:13:13.167 --> 00:13:15.000
Those things don't matter to me!

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:19.458
To me, the current Mikono is...!

00:13:19.458 --> 00:13:21.333
Amata...!

00:13:21.333 --> 00:13:22.667
Amata...

00:13:22.667 --> 00:13:29.917
The Mikono that is right here with us now is...!

00:13:29.917 --> 00:13:32.500
Then I'll check right here, right now...

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:37.917
...which is stronger--my fate or
that oppressive feeling of yours!

00:13:48.417 --> 00:13:49.917
Amata!

00:13:55.708 --> 00:13:57.208
What?!

00:13:58.458 --> 00:14:00.125
Solar Wing!

00:14:06.375 --> 00:14:10.625
I'm not going to lose to the likes of you!

00:14:15.375 --> 00:14:20.083
Soon... Soon the melody
I've been seeking will...

00:14:23.042 --> 00:14:25.208
--Shrade!
--Shrade!

00:14:25.208 --> 00:14:28.458
Hey! What's wrong, Shrade?!

00:14:28.458 --> 00:14:31.500
Are you hearing this, good friend?

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:33.625
Isn't it a beautiful tone?

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:47.375
--Silffy!
--Mikono!

00:14:53.167 --> 00:14:55.750
Shrade's bio level has reached
the lowest acceptable level!

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:58.667
If he continues to fight,
it could cost him his life!

00:14:58.667 --> 00:15:02.417
Element change! Yunoha will replace Shrade!

00:15:02.417 --> 00:15:04.750
Please wait!

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:07.042
I can still fight!

00:15:07.042 --> 00:15:11.792
I'm almost there! Soon I'll be able to...!

00:15:11.792 --> 00:15:14.375
Element Change! Hurry!

00:15:17.125 --> 00:15:19.792
Yunoha Suroor! Ready to fight!

00:15:28.792 --> 00:15:30.333
I'm not gonna let you run!

00:15:35.417 --> 00:15:39.792
Mythic Aquarion's high-dimensional
quantum energy level is off the charts!

00:15:39.792 --> 00:15:43.875
Fudo, what on earth are you trying to do?

00:15:43.875 --> 00:15:48.167
I thought everything was written
in the Book of the Twin Stars.

00:15:48.167 --> 00:15:52.500
Myths are written only by noble lives.

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:57.000
That's right... Using shed blood in lieu of ink.

00:15:58.458 --> 00:16:00.417
So you're not going to stop it?

00:16:00.417 --> 00:16:03.333
Stopping and moving are the same thing.

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:09.208
When you put your hands together,
what exists in between?

00:16:09.208 --> 00:16:14.333
There isn't anything there.
Only "nothing" exists there.

00:16:14.333 --> 00:16:18.083
However, "nothing" is "nothing,"
and yet, is not "nothing."

00:16:18.083 --> 00:16:24.667
Plus and minus... These two powers
offset each other and form "nothing."

00:16:24.667 --> 00:16:28.792
Mikono Suzushiro's
connecting power is the same.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:34.208
Light and darkness.
Pure and corrupt. Good and evil.

00:16:34.208 --> 00:16:37.875
And yin and yang...

00:16:37.875 --> 00:16:41.208
The two closed memories are opened

00:16:41.208 --> 00:16:45.458
and the infinite power
born from nothing is stirred.

00:16:45.458 --> 00:16:50.083
And now, a new page is opened!

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:25.750
What?!

00:17:30.917 --> 00:17:33.292
I-I can't keep up!

00:17:39.917 --> 00:17:44.167
Solar Wing... I will hold it in my arms!

00:17:50.542 --> 00:17:52.625
The Mythic Aquarion is...!

00:17:57.167 --> 00:17:59.375
Amata!

00:17:59.375 --> 00:18:01.708
The gate is opened. We're gonna go, too!

00:18:01.708 --> 00:18:03.208
What?

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:22.333
Two Abductors and the Mythic Aquarion
went into the dimensional gate!

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:28.458
Please... Director Crea.

00:18:28.458 --> 00:18:32.542
One more time...
Please let me go one more time.

00:18:34.333 --> 00:18:37.750
It'll cost you your life this time.

00:18:41.833 --> 00:18:47.833
Ever since you took me in and brought
me to Neo-DEAVA, you must've known

00:18:47.833 --> 00:18:50.042
that this day would eventually come.

00:19:09.833 --> 00:19:12.500
Please promise me one thing.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:16.833
Promise me that you'll let me
hear your completed opus, too.

00:19:25.667 --> 00:19:27.167
Mikono!

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:31.792
Shrade?!

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:36.500
Both Vector machines went
into the dimensional gate!

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.125
Monitoring will be cut off!

00:19:44.667 --> 00:19:46.292
Where are Mikono and Kagura?!

00:19:46.292 --> 00:19:47.792
Amata!

00:19:53.167 --> 00:19:56.333
Before I play my last opus...

00:19:56.333 --> 00:19:59.458
...we'll get the Mythic Aquarion back!

00:19:59.458 --> 00:20:01.250
But the two of us alone can't...!

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:03.167
I'll merge with you!

00:20:03.167 --> 00:20:05.333
Zessica! So you are okay!

00:20:06.458 --> 00:20:08.083
Amata...

00:20:08.083 --> 00:20:10.958
This is how I show my love!

00:20:10.958 --> 00:20:15.000
Unmei Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:20:23.042 --> 00:20:25.417
Ahh! Amata!

00:20:25.417 --> 00:20:27.750
Thank you, Zessica.

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:31.000
Oh... My soul is shivering!

00:20:36.083 --> 00:20:38.500
Aquarion Spada!

00:20:42.125 --> 00:20:43.667
The Mythic Aquarion is...!

00:20:48.125 --> 00:20:49.625
I got you!

00:20:53.875 --> 00:20:55.833
Incredible!

00:20:55.833 --> 00:20:59.417
Now, repent!

00:20:59.417 --> 00:21:01.708
Crucifixion Sword!

00:21:20.792 --> 00:21:22.292
Shrade!

00:21:27.833 --> 00:21:29.458
Dimensional gate activated!

00:21:29.458 --> 00:21:32.250
Mithra Gnis has broken into our territory!

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:34.833
A Rare Igura is detected in its cockpit!

00:21:34.833 --> 00:21:38.167
The Rare Igura that Kagura
is so obsessed with...

00:21:39.542 --> 00:21:43.417
I feel that this time, for sure,
we have the true Eve.

00:21:43.417 --> 00:21:45.583
Prepare to move out!

00:21:45.583 --> 00:21:49.792
We cannot let Kagura keep
the true Eve all to himself!

00:21:56.167 --> 00:21:58.333
Crustal movements and abnormal
weather are being reported

00:21:58.333 --> 00:22:00.167
from all over the world!

00:22:00.167 --> 00:22:04.542
Now that the Mythic Aquarion's seal is broken,

00:22:04.542 --> 00:22:09.375
it has disrupted the balance that
has existed between Altair and Vega.

00:22:09.375 --> 00:22:11.750
The Mythic Aquarion has been taken away

00:22:11.750 --> 00:22:16.042
and communications with Shrade
and Amata are offline...!

00:22:16.042 --> 00:22:18.375
Is there anything we can do?!

00:22:18.375 --> 00:22:21.208
What will happen to the world?

00:22:21.208 --> 00:22:24.000
It's too soon to give up.

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:30.250
Solar Wing won't activate
without the chosen Element.

00:22:34.167 --> 00:22:36.667
The time has finally come.

00:22:39.542 --> 00:22:43.000
I'll have you fulfill your promise...

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:46.000
You, the one with bright green hair...

00:22:59.167 --> 00:23:07.083
<i>Kimi e tsuzuku sakamichi ni</i>
<i>shiroi hana ga saiteta</i>

00:23:07.083 --> 00:23:14.708
<i>Yume kara sameta ato mo kanashii sora miteta</i>

00:23:19.292 --> 00:23:25.083
<i>Kono kimochi happa no ura ni sunderu</i>

00:23:26.708 --> 00:23:34.542
<i>Asatsuyu ga ochiru oto ni mimi o sumaseteru no</i>

00:23:34.542 --> 00:23:42.333
<i>Kami sama anata ga tsukutta</i>
<i>sekai wa kanpeki ja nai</i>

00:23:42.333 --> 00:23:50.125
<i>Koko de wa mainichi koi ga</i>
<i>poroporo shinde yuku</i>

00:23:50.125 --> 00:23:53.958
<i>Hajimete suki ni natta no</i>

00:23:53.958 --> 00:23:57.250
<i>Anata wa shiranai desho</i>

00:23:57.250 --> 00:24:01.708
<i>Chikyuu no uragawa de ii kara</i>

00:24:01.708 --> 00:24:04.917
<i>Soba ni ite hoshikatta</i>

00:24:04.917 --> 00:24:09.417
<i>Watashi o wasurete mo ii kara</i>

00:24:09.417 --> 00:24:15.500
<i>Soba ni ite hoshikatta</i>

00:24:19.417 --> 00:24:22.417
I'll tell you what I like.

00:24:22.417 --> 00:24:26.208
Petals with spots and Kagura's scream.

00:24:26.208 --> 00:24:28.667
I'll tell you what I don't like.

00:24:30.333 --> 00:24:33.458
"Next Episode 'Melody of Myth'"
Lies, betrayal... and that man.
